  "description": "SonataSmooth.Tune provides high-performance smoothing and filtering algorithms for numerical data arrays. Supported methods include Rectangular Moving Average, Binomial Weighted Average, Weighted Median, Gaussian Filtering, and Savitzky-Golay Polynomial Smoothing. The library is designed for scientific, engineering, and signal processing applications, and offers easy integration with .NET projects. All algorithms are implemented as static methods for maximum efficiency and thread safety.",
